<ui:UXML xmlns:ui="UnityEngine.UIElements" xmlns:uie="UnityEditor.UIElements" xsi:schemaLocation="UnityEngine.UIElements ../../UIElementsSchema/UnityEngine.UIElements.xsd" xmlns:xsi="http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema-instance" editor-extension-mode="False">
    <Style src="project:/Assets/UI/Styles/GlobalStyles.uss" />
    
    <!-- Root Container: Flex Column -->
    <ui:VisualElement name="root" class="bg-gradient" style="flex-grow: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column;">

        <!-- Background Particles -->
        <ui:VisualElement name="home-particle-layer" class="particle-container" picking-mode="Ignore" style="position: absolute; top: 0; bottom: 0; left: 0; right: 0;" />

        <!-- CONTENT AREA -->
        <ui:VisualElement name="content-area" style="flex-grow: 1; padding: 36px; padding-bottom: 0;">
            
            <!-- HOME PANEL -->
            <ui:VisualElement name="home-panel" style="flex-grow: 1;">
                <!-- Header Profile — Glassmorphism Card -->
                <ui:VisualElement name="header" style="flex-direction: row; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 40px;">
                    <ui:VisualElement style="flex-direction: row; align-items: center;">
                        <ui:Button name="open-profile-btn" style="flex-direction: row; align-items: center; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-width: 1px; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); border-radius: 22px; padding: 12px 18px; margin: 0; margin-right: 20px;">
                            <ui:VisualElement name="avatar" class="avatar-ring" style="width: 100px; height: 100px; border-radius: 50px; margin-right: 20px;" />
                            <ui:VisualElement name="labels" style="align-items: flex-start;">
                                <ui:Label name="name-label" text="PLAYER NAME" style="color: white; font-size: 36px; -unity-font-style: bold; margin-bottom: 8px;" />
                                <ui:Label name="level-tag" text="LEVEL 5" class="header-tag" style="font-size: 29px; padding: 6px 12px; margin-bottom: 8px;" />
                                <!-- XP Bar -->
                                <ui:VisualElement class="xp-bar-container" style="width: 280px; height: 16px;">
                                    <ui:VisualElement name="xp-fill" class="xp-bar-fill" style="width: 0%; height: 100%;" />
                                </ui:VisualElement>
                                <ui:Label name="xp-label" text="0 / 500" style="color: rgba(255,255,255,0.35); font-size: 19px; margin-top: 4px;" />
                            </ui:VisualElement>
                        </ui:Button>

                        <ui:VisualElement name="money-block" style="flex-direction: row; align-items: center; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-width: 1px; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); border-radius: 22px; padding: 12px 24px;">
                            <ui:Label text="&#128176;" style="font-size: 43px; margin-right: 12px;" />
                            <ui:Label name="money-label" text="$1,250" style="color: #FFD166; -unity-font-style: bold; font-size: 43px;" />
                        </ui:VisualElement>
                    </ui:VisualElement>

                    <ui:Button name="settings-btn" class="icon-btn" text="&#9881;" />
                </ui:VisualElement>

                <!-- Hero Banner — Glassmorphism glow -->
                <ui:VisualElement name="hero" style="align-items: center; margin-bottom: 50px; padding: 24px;">
                    <ui:Label text="PVP QUIZ GAME" class="hero-title" />
                    <ui:Label text="THU THACH KIEN THUC" class="hero-subtitle" />
                </ui:VisualElement>

                <!-- Main Content (Center) -->
                <ui:VisualElement name="content" style="flex-grow: 1; justify-content: center; align-items: center;">
                    <!-- Primary CTA — Tìm trận -->
                    <ui:Button name="find-match-btn" text="TIM TRAN DAU" class="btn btn-glow" style="width: 100%; max-width: 85%; height: 140px; font-size: 50px; margin-bottom: 20px; border-radius: 26px; letter-spacing: 2px;" />

                    <!-- Secondary — Đấu máy -->
                    <ui:Button name="practice-btn" text="DAU VOI MAY" class="btn btn-secondary" style="width: 100%; max-width: 78%; height: 110px; font-size: 40px; margin-bottom: 20px; border-radius: 22px;" />
                </ui:VisualElement>
            </ui:VisualElement>

            <!-- SHOP PANEL (Ẩn mặc định) -->
            <ui:VisualElement name="shop-panel" class="main-panel" style="display: none; align-items: center; justify-content: center;">
                <ui:Label text="&#128722;" style="font-size: 144px; margin-bottom: 20px;" />
                <ui:Label name="shop-title-label" text="CUA HANG" style="font-size: 72px; color: white; -unity-font-style: bold; margin-bottom: 10px;" />
                <ui:Label name="shop-coming-soon-label" text="Tinh nang dang duoc phat trien (Coming Soon)" style="font-size: 36px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.5);" />
            </ui:VisualElement>

            <!-- LEADERBOARD PANEL (Hidden by default) -->
            <ui:VisualElement name="leaderboard-panel" style="flex-grow: 1; display: none; padding-bottom: 20px;">
                <!-- Sub-tabs -->
                <ui:VisualElement class="sub-tabs-container">
                    <ui:Button name="subtab-leaderboard-btn" class="sub-tab-btn sub-tab-active" text="XEP HANG" />
                    <ui:Button name="subtab-achievements-btn" class="sub-tab-btn" text="THANH TUU" />
                </ui:VisualElement>

                <!-- Top Rank Points Content -->
                <ui:VisualElement name="subpanel-leaderboard" class="card-glow" style="flex-grow: 1; padding: 20px; border-radius: 28px;">
                    <ui:Label name="leaderboard-loading-label" text="Dang tai du lieu..." style="font-size: 36px; color: white; -unity-text-align: middle-center; flex-grow: 1;" />
                    <ui:ScrollView name="leaderboard-scroll" style="flex-grow: 1; display: none;" />
                </ui:VisualElement>

                <!-- Achievements Content -->
                <ui:VisualElement name="subpanel-achievements" class="card-glow" style="flex-grow: 1; padding: 20px; border-radius: 28px; display: none;">
                    <ui:ScrollView name="achievements-scroll" style="flex-grow: 1;" />
                </ui:VisualElement>
            </ui:VisualElement>

            <!-- MATCHMAKING PANEL (Hidden by default) — Spinner -->
            <ui:VisualElement name="matchmaking-panel" style="flex-grow: 1; justify-content: center; align-items: center; display: none;">
                <!-- Glass card for matchmaking -->
                <ui:VisualElement style="align-items: center; background-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.05); border-radius: 28px; padding: 50px 40px; border-width: 1px; border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.1); min-width: 350px;">
                    <ui:VisualElement class="spinner" />
                    <ui:Label name="searching-label" text="DANG TIM DOI THU..." style="font-size: 43px; color: white; margin-bottom: 8px; letter-spacing: 2px; -unity-font-style: bold;" />
                    <ui:Label text="Vui long cho trong giay lat" style="font-size: 26px; color: rgba(255,255,255,0.3); margin-bottom: 50px;" />
                    <ui:Button name="cancel-match-btn" text="HUY TIM KIEM" class="btn btn-danger" style="width: 320px; height: 90px; font-size: 36px; border-radius: 22px;" />
                </ui:VisualElement>
            </ui:VisualElement>
            
        </ui:VisualElement>

        <!-- BOTTOM NAVIGATION BAR -->
        <ui:VisualElement class="bottom-nav">
            <ui:Button name="nav-shop-btn" class="nav-tab">
                <ui:Label text="&#128722;" class="nav-tab-icon" />
                <ui:Label text="SHOP" class="nav-tab-label" />
            </ui:Button>

            <ui:Button name="nav-home-btn" class="nav-tab nav-tab-active">
                <ui:Label text="&#127968;" class="nav-tab-icon" />
                <ui:Label text="HOME" class="nav-tab-label" />
            </ui:Button>

            <ui:Button name="nav-leaderboard-btn" class="nav-tab">
                <ui:Label text="&#127942;" class="nav-tab-icon" />
                <ui:Label text="RANK" class="nav-tab-label" />
            </ui:Button>
        </ui:VisualElement>
        
    </ui:VisualElement>
</ui:UXML>
